{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1384216,\"title\":\"The Dog Stars\",\"tagline\":\"At the end of the world, no one survives alone.\",\"overview\":\"After the world's population has been ravaged by a pandemic, a man lives a lonesome existence in a Colorado airplane hangar with his dog and a dour gunman he has befriended. When a mysterious transmission comes through on the radio while he’s flying his old Cessna, it sparks a hunt for the provenance of the sound.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5O616X9vmRzQdB68PHzBewPittd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3k7GzxOdLZkN3eZsuhLi2eRzkXO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":1055,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":119,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":110000000,\"revenue\":39203493,\"director\":\"Ridley Scott\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":578,\"name\":\"Ridley Scott\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zABJmN9opmqD4orWl3KSdCaSo7Q.jpg\"},{\"id\":2034418,\"name\":\"Jacob Elordi\",\"character\":\"Hig\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9FGS8AGjVNtpWuUeoipYWR23sRZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":16851,\"name\":\"Josh Brolin\",\"character\":\"Bangley\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7QpneI3HoZCCDVPyWx3p3t7yeo7.jpg\"},{\"id\":1392137,\"name\":\"Margaret Qualley\",\"character\":\"Cima\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r5WeMrU4YLJqRRE3joeOrBVicAH.jpg\"},{\"id\":529,\"name\":\"Guy Pearce\",\"character\":\"Pops\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vTqk6Nh3WgqPubkS23eOlMAwmwa.jpg\"},{\"id\":30082,\"name\":\"Benedict Wong\",\"character\":\"Aaron\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yYfLyrC2CE6vBWSJfkpuVKL2POM.jpg\"},{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"Allison Janney\",\"character\":\"Darlene\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AnpevvFjyFPRL3vDGo7o1Woina1.jpg\"},{\"id\":1125,\"name\":\"Ewe